OL,3,GNEWSA'They were lovely', say fans
OL,4,Aduring Harry and Meghan's first joint
OL,5,Atour in Nottingham since UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are met
OL,8,Fwith cheers and shouts of "I love you"
OL,9,Fas they tour Nottingham on their first
OL,10,Froyal-style joint engagement since
OL,11,Freturning to the UK
OL,13,FHarry and Meghan have arrived at
OL,14,FHimmah, a charity tackling food
OL,15,Fpoverty. "They're an amazing and
OL,16,Fspecial couple," says Lucy Beardsall,
OL,17,Fwho has been waiting with her husband
OL,18,FDarren to greet the pair
OL,20,FThe pair's first stop was the Community
OL,21,FRecording Studio (CRS) charity, a place
OL,22,FHarry has a long relationship with
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
