OL,3,GNEWSA'They were lovely', say fans
OL,4,Aduring Harry and Meghan's first joint
OL,5,Atour in Nottingham since UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmily Davis, 21, gave Meghan a bunch of
OL,8,Fyellow flowers. "I just said, 'I've
OL,9,Falways wanted to meet you'," she tells
OL,10,Fthe BBC, while Amanda Geary, 54, says
OL,11,Fshe's "been a fan of Harry ever since
OL,12,Fhe was born"
OL,14,FReece Sweeney-Fenton, who travelled
OL,15,Fwith his partner Kiara to be there,
OL,16,Fsays he is glad they're "giving England
OL,17,Fanother go"
OL,19,FHarry and Meghan are in the city where
OL,20,Fthey made their first joint appearance
OL,21,Fafter announcing their engagement in
OL,22,F2017
